# Default Subagent-Driven Development

When continuing development from `docs/superpowers/handoffs/*` or executing a multi-step implementation plan, prefer the Superpowers `subagent-driven-development` workflow.

Use the main agent as the coordinator:

- Read the handoff or plan once.
- Extract only the current task, acceptance criteria, relevant files, and constraints.
- Dispatch one fresh subagent per implementation task.
- Run spec compliance review before code quality review.
- Do not send the entire handoff document to every subagent.
- Do not mark a task complete until implementation, tests, spec review, and code quality review are complete.

Do not use this workflow for tiny fixes, simple questions, or tightly coupled changes unless the user explicitly asks for it.
